  "pli-tv-bu-vb-pc48:2.13.1": "“Army” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>uyyutta sena</i>, which might be rendered “a mobilized army”. At the time of the Buddha it seems armies consisted entirely of reserve troops that would then be mobilized at times of war. With the advent of professional armies, however, armies are always more or less mobilized. Thus my rendering. ",
